{"id":"5181eae692600fece732552a4ee90476de55bfa4","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247211","title":"你们用 AI 写代码，会每次都看它改了什么吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"sft6888","excerpt":"程序员 - @sft6888 - 想问问大家，让 AI 改完代码以后，你们会逐行看 diff ，还是功能试一下没问题就提交？只改几行还好，一次改了十几个文件，看起来也挺费劲。但完全不看，又怕它顺手改了不该改的地方。你们","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>想问问大家，让 AI 改完代码以后，你们会逐行看 diff ，还是功能试一下没问题就提交？</p><p>只改几行还好，一次改了十几个文件，看起来也挺费劲。但完全不看，又怕它顺手改了不该改的地方。</p><p>你们一般怎么检查？有没有哪些部分是一定会自己看的？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/检查\"><li></li> 检查</a></P><p><span>79 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-09 22:45:28 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157467\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bee/b6c9/91836_normal.png?m=1743566568\" alt=\"ZRS\" data-uid=\"91836\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ZRS\">ZRS</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 00:14:34 +08:00\">23h 36m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以前会 现在看不过来了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157481\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1d7d/8905/477613_normal.png?m=1586326604\" alt=\"XTTX\" data-uid=\"477613\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/XTTX\">XTTX</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 00:34:01 +08:00\">23h 17m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>你太高看我了, 我看不懂啊. 哪一部分都不是我写的啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157513\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1788532163\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 01:42:08 +08:00\">22h 9m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 10</span>\n                    \n                    <p>看是肯定要看的，不要急着交付，倒杯茶慢慢看。有的人说我从不看，这个没必要攀比。我看是因为如果有问题我能看得出来，他不看是因为如果有问题他也看不出来。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157514\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8fba/190c/445250_normal.png?m=1777281577\" alt=\"voidmnwzp\" data-uid=\"445250\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/voidmnwzp\">voidmnwzp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 01:42:44 +08:00\">22h 8m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>难道现在真有人会一行行看吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157613\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3e9f/0fc9/4848_normal.png?m=1791098818\" alt=\"txican\" data-uid=\"4848\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/txican\">txican</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 07:44:39 +08:00\">16h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不忙才看代码, 忙着交付就只看测试结果.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157614\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3e9f/0fc9/4848_normal.png?m=1791098818\" alt=\"txican\" data-uid=\"4848\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/txican\">txican</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 07:45:26 +08:00\">16h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你就把 AI 当作你手下的人, 你什么时候看 TA 写的代码, 什么时候不看?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157625\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bda7ca9aa4308a060964140c2e42d0a4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"connor123\" data-uid=\"577349\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/connor123\">connor123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 07:58:16 +08:00\">15h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/txican\">txican</a> #7 我不看下面的人写的代码，是因为出了问题他背锅，ai 写的代码，出了问题，我能跟 leader 说都是 ai 写的，跟我没关系吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157702\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a7a1/267e/85487_normal.png?m=1708843021\" alt=\"ZxBing0066\" data-uid=\"85487\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ZxBing0066\">ZxBing0066</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 08:42:19 +08:00\">15h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看项目，公司的、重要的看，玩具不看，挂了无所谓的不看。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157730\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 08:51:22 +08:00\">15h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不看，流程是把需求写清楚，写详细，然后代码写完了再测试一下功能是否完成。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157732\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d77c204b9fb7c9057e81140190276a29?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fredweili\" data-uid=\"636914\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fredweili\">fredweili</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 08:53:00 +08:00\">14h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>生产代码一点点改，都要 review ，有些 context 在脑子里<br>研究 POC 那就无所谓了，能跑就行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157733\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4b8e5b60a3bfc144906867c8aa6088e9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dgq0219\" data-uid=\"729853\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dgq0219\">dgq0219</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 08:53:08 +08:00\">14h 58m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/XTTX\">XTTX</a> 哈哈哈哈，确实看不懂，任由它乱写</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157744\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b9c7/2bd6/240871_normal.png?m=1791335149\" alt=\"zackkk\" data-uid=\"240871\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zackkk\">zackkk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 08:56:12 +08:00\">14h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>生产代码，不看迟早等着爆雷吧。<br>一般代码要看看代码结构，使用方案。最大的问题是总是不用最优/最新方案，带来的问题是未来扩展成本变大。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157754\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/aae68d9741eb2a7e89994bcf57eda1dc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ptstone\" data-uid=\"526963\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ptstone\">ptstone</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 08:58:53 +08:00\">14h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不看，人脑已经干不过 ai 了， 那么多代码也看不过来，写代码前后， 让 ai 按照文档 review ，把逻辑都实现，风险都列出来，多测试。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157781\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af5e/0385/651753_normal.png?m=1695968108\" alt=\"sleek7671\" data-uid=\"651753\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sleek7671\">sleek7671</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 09:04:30 +08:00\">14h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最初的时候会，后来跟不上了，于是连同测试也让它自洽了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157829\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/038b/d442/400625_normal.png?m=1728535864\" alt=\"guin\" data-uid=\"400625\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/guin\">guin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 09:13:15 +08:00\">14h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>估计以后都不会了，就像论坛很多人说的，都换 rust 了，但估计没几个看的懂 ai 写的 rust 代码</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18157860\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/15ab424bfee1bb4c078cd22675f2928e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wysnxzm\" data-uid=\"588304\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wysnxzm\">wysnxzm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 09:17:53 +08:00\">14h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看得懂可以选择不看,看不懂只能不看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158013\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1d7d/8905/477613_normal.png?m=1586326604\" alt=\"XTTX\" data-uid=\"477613\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/XTTX\">XTTX</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 09:37:49 +08:00\">14h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/dgq0219\">dgq0219</a> 你看看那些 blender, threejs 和那些光效 shader. 以前没有个把月和几年的经验, 谁写得出来.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158046\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a011e148d8df7acf291a20aa7b83f9cb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"CainGao\" data-uid=\"457570\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CainGao\">CainGao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 09:43:17 +08:00\">14h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看看 git 提交后，看一下改了哪几个文件.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158064\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6dbd093177c8578b309035e8b6ac4c45?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nilaoda\" data-uid=\"380937\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nilaoda\">nilaoda</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 09:45:25 +08:00\">14h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只开个 GitHub Desktop 看下 diff ，大致扫一眼，没有逐行看了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158116\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0e62/8909/162943_normal.png?m=1768878664\" alt=\"Kontinue\" data-uid=\"162943\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Kontinue\">Kontinue</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 09:52:05 +08:00\">13h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>看，写的不一定对，尤其是改了大量代码的。看不懂就贴给他问他，合理就行了，有些也不用全看懂。</p><p>poc 和运维类的看的少，能跑就行。 业务类的还是得看的，不然坑多</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158280\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4fa6b3cebe56740b5c785c6726625ca4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bixinhaner\" data-uid=\"315720\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bixinhaner\">bixinhaner</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 10:11:42 +08:00\">13h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在是 2026 年 10 月，能看看改了哪些文件就很不错了，再以后这都不会看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158316\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4c74/1a2a/472934_normal.png?m=1782221594\" alt=\"nekochyan\" data-uid=\"472934\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nekochyan\">nekochyan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 10:16:11 +08:00\">13h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>上线的代码我会看，毕竟出了问题会被扣工资；技术优化、小工具类的肯定不看了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158334\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b3d0/4cbe/427384_normal.png?m=1755166367\" alt=\"94\" data-uid=\"427384\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/94\">94</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 10:17:48 +08:00\">13h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我会要求拆分成很细的 commit ，一个 PR 和 MR 也不会有改非常多的文件。大概把修改的文件点开 diff 搂一眼没有感觉到坏味道就行了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158397\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/05e2/a064/8885_normal.png?m=1752827750\" alt=\"wowh\" data-uid=\"8885\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wowh\">wowh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-09 10:26:55 +08:00\">13h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只看看大的架构，都审阅怎么可能</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18158459\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5d786c60e181a689c15d211054743112?s=48&d=retro\" alt